{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"史自遷、固，以迄晉、唐，其為書雄深浩博，讀者未能盡曉。於是裴駰、顏師古、李賢、何超、董衝諸儒，訓詁音釋，然後制度、名物、方言、奇字，可以一覽而周知。其有助於後學多矣。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"遼之初興，與奚、室韋密邇，土俗言語大概近俚。至太祖、太宗，奄有朔方，其治雖參用漢法，而先世奇首、遙輦之制尚多存者。子孫相繼，亦遵守而不易。故史之所載，官制、宮衛、部族、地理，率以國語為之稱號。不有註釋以辨之，則世何從而知，後何從而考哉。今即本史參互研究，撰次遼國語解以附其後，庶幾讀者無齟齬之患云。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"帝紀","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"太祖紀：","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"耶律氏","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"蕭氏","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"本紀首書太祖姓耶律氏，繼書皇后蕭氏，則有國之初，已分二姓矣。有謂始興之地曰世里，譯者以世里為耶律，故國族皆以耶律為姓。有謂述律皇后兄子名蕭翰者，為宣武軍節度使，其妹復為皇后，故后族皆以蕭為姓。其說與紀不合，故陳大任不取。又有言以漢字書者曰耶律、蕭，以契丹字書者曰移剌、石抹，則亦無可考矣。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"霞瀨益石烈","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"鄉名。諸宮下皆有石烈，設官治之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"彌里","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"鄉之小者。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"撻馬狘沙里","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"撻馬，人從也。沙里，郎君也。管率眾人之官。後有止稱撻馬者。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"大迭烈府","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"即迭剌部之府也。初，阻午可汗與其弟撒里本領之，及太祖以部夷離菫即位，因強大難制，析為二院。烈、剌音相近。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"夷离菫","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"統軍馬大官。會同初，改為大王。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"集會堝下窩、陀二音。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"地名。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"阿主沙里","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"阿主，父祖稱。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"惕隱","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"典族屬官。即宗正職也。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"奚、霫下音習。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"國名。中京地也。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"黑車子","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"國也。以善製車帳得名。契丹之先，嘗遣人往學之。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"于越","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"貴官，無所職。其位居北、南大王上，非有大功德者不授。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"鷹軍","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"鷹，鷙鳥；以之名軍，取捷速之義。後記龍軍、虎軍、鐵鷂軍者，倣此。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"嗢娘改上音丸。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"地名。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"西樓","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"遼有四樓：在上京者曰西樓；木葉山曰南樓；龍化州曰東樓；唐州曰北樓。歲時遊獵，常在四樓間。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"阿點夷離的","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"阿點，貴稱。夷離的，大臣夫人之稱。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"糾轄","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"糾，軍名。轄者，管束之義。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"夷離畢","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"即參知政事，後置夷離畢院以掌刑政。宋刁約使遼有詩云「押宴夷離畢」，知其為執政官也。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"射鬼箭","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"凡帝親征，服介冑，祭諸先帝，出則取死囚一人，置所向之方，亂矢射之，名射鬼箭，以祓不祥。及班師，則射所俘。後因為刑法之用。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"暴里","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"惡人名也。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"大、小鵠軍","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"二室韋軍號也。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"神纛","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"從者所執。以旄牛尾為之，纓槍屬也。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"龍眉宮","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"太祖取天梯、蒙國、別魯三山之勢于葦淀，射金齪箭以識之，名龍眉宮。神冊三年，築都城于其地，臨潢府是也。齪，測角切，箭名。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"崤里","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"室韋部名。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"君基太一神","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"福神名。其神所臨之國，君能建極，孚于上下，則治化升平，民享多福。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"撻林","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"官名。後二室韋部改為僕射，又名司空。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"舍利","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"契丹豪民耍裹頭巾者，納牛駝十頭，馬百疋，乃給官名曰舍利。後遂為諸帳官，以郎君繫之。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"阿廬朵里一名阿魯敦。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"貴顯名。遼于越官兼此者，惟曷魯耳。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"選底","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"主獄官。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"常袞","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"官名。掌遙輦部族戶籍等事；奚六部常袞掌奚之族屬。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"諲譔","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"渤海國主名。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"剋釋魯","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"剋，官名。釋魯，人名。後剋朗、剋臺哂倣此。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"烏魯古、阿里只","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"太祖及述律后受諲譔降時所乘二馬名也，因賜諲譔夫婦以為名。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"太宗紀：","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"箭笴山笴音簳。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"胡損奚所居。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"柴冊","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"禮名。積薪為壇，受群臣玉冊。禮畢，燔柴，祀天。阻午可汗制也。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"遙輦氏九帳","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"遙輦九可汗宮分。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"北剋、南剋","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"掌軍官名，猶漢南北軍之職。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"祭麃鹿神","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"遼俗好射麃鹿，每出獵，必祭其神以祈多獲。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"林牙","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"掌文翰官，時稱為學士。其群牧所設，止管簿書。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"瑟瑟禮","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"祈雨射柳之儀，遙輦蘇可汗制。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"再生禮","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"國俗，每十二年一次，行始生之禮，名曰再生。惟帝與太后、太子及夷離菫得行之。又名覆誕。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"神速姑","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"宗室人名，能知蛇語。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"蒲割〈寧頁〉下乃頂切。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"公主名也。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"三剋","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"統軍官，猶云三帥也。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"詳穩","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"諸官府監治長官。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"梯里已","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"諸部下官也，後陞司徒。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"達剌干","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"縣官也，後陞副使。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"麻都不","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"縣官之佐也，後陞為令。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"馬步","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"未詳何官，以達剌干陞為之。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"牙署","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"官名。疑即牙書，石烈官也。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_107","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"世燭","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_108","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"遙輦帳侍中之官。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_109","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"敞史","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_110","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"官府之佐吏也。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_111","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"思奴古","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_112","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"官與敞史相近。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_113","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"徒睹古","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_114","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"邊徼外小國。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_115","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"世宗、穆宗紀：","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_116","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"蹛林上音帶。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_117","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"地名，即松林故地。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_118","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"閘撒狘","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_119","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"抹里司官，亦掌宮衛之禁者。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_120","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"撻馬","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_121","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"扈從之官。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_122","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"濃兀","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_123","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"部分名。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_124","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"葉格戲","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_125","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"宋錢僖公家有葉子揭格之戲。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_126","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"景宗、聖宗紀：","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_127","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"飛龍使","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_128","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"掌馬官，亦為導騎。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_129","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"橫帳","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_130","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"德祖族屬號三父房，稱橫帳，宗室之尤貴者。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_131","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"著帳","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_132","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"凡世官之家及諸色人，因事籍沒者為著帳戶，官有著帳郎君。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_133","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"杓窊印","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_134","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"杓窊，鷙鳥總稱，以為印紐，取疾速之義。凡調發軍馬則用之，與金魚符、銀牌略同。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_135","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"國舅帳剋","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_136","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"官制有大國舅帳，此則本帳下掌兵之官。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_137","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"拜奧禮","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_138","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"凡納后，即族中選尊者一人當奧而坐，以主其禮，謂之奧姑。送后者拜而致敬，故云拜奧禮。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_139","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"拜山禮","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_140","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"祀木葉山之儀。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_141","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"敞穩","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_142","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"諸帳下官。亦作常袞，蓋字音相近也。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_143","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"萬役陷河冶","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_144","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"地名。本漢土垠縣，有銀礦。太祖募民立寨以專採煉，故名陷河冶。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_145","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"合蘇袞","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_146","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"女直別部名，又作曷蘇館。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_147","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"執手禮","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_148","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"將帥有克敵功，上親執手慰勞；若將在軍，則遣人代行執手禮。優遇之意。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_149","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"阿札割只","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_150","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"官名。位在樞密使下，蓋墩官也。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_151","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"四捷軍","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_152","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"遼以宋降者分立二部：一曰四捷軍，一曰歸聖軍。","sentenceOr