以帛為通曆，具一庫之物，盡數籍之，曰臨庫。","sentenceOrder":414},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_415","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"堂帖","sentenceOrder":415},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_416","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"遼制，宰相凡除拜，行頭子堂帖權差，俟再取旨，出給告敕。故官有知頭子事。見陰山雜錄。","sentenceOrder":416},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_417","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"夷離菫畫者","sentenceOrder":417},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_418","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"畫者人名，為夷離菫官。","sentenceOrder":418},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_419","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"虎斯","sentenceOrder":419},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_116_420","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_116","textTraditional":"有力稱。紀言「虎思」，義同。","sentenceOrder":420}],"overrides":{}}